  lines.push("The roll decides the find, in these amounts. Failure or critical failure: nothing worth keeping. Mixed results: 1 of the everyday find. Basic success: 1 or 2. Success: exactly 2 or 3. Great success: 3 or 4, and the better find if there is one. Critical success: 4, and the better find if there is one. Never more than 4 of the everyday find in one attempt. Below a great success, do not mention the better find at all. If no roll was made, treat it as a basic success.")
